Package: chromodoris
Title: Chromodoris Plots of Many Time Series
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jeffrey", "Girard", , "me@jmgirard.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Tools for the Chromodoris plot, which summarizes many time
    series (one per rater or unit) moment by moment as nested quantile
    ribbons around a center line. Provides a ggplot2 stat that computes
    the bands and a wrapper that draws the whole plot with one call.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/jmgirard/chromodoris, https://jmgirard.github.io/chromodoris/
